* Simulation controls replace Falstad's clickable SPST switches.
.subckt SW_CTRL A B CTRL
S1 A B CTRL 0 MANUAL_SW
.model MANUAL_SW SW(Ron=0.01 Roff=1G Vt=0.5 Vh=0.1)
.ends SW_CTRL
* Generic, not manufacturer-specific semiconductor models.
* MOSFET Kp=0.02 and Vto=1.5 give the approximately 0.195V drain
* voltage / 16.4mA per coil in the supplied Falstad running snapshot.
.model NFET_GLV NMOS(Vto=1.5 Kp=0.02 Lambda=0)
* Diode and red LED models retained from the newer LTspice reference.
.model D_FLY D(Is=1n Rs=0.5 N=1.8 Cjo=4p Bv=100)
.model LED_RED D(Is=93.1p Rs=42 N=3.73 Cjo=2.97p M=0.333 tt=4.32u)
